---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Deanna Tran - Senior Product Engineer | Cloudflare"
  description="Deanna Tran is a Senior Product Engineer at Cloudflare in NYC, operating like an internal forward-deployed engineer across security and trust. She focuses on fixing underlying workflows and thrives in high-ambiguity loops."
>
  <section class="intro mb-16 relative flex items-stretch gap-8 justify-center max-md:flex-col max-md:items-center">
    <!-- Mobile: bust shot image -->
    <img src="/kawaii_me.svg" alt="Deanna Tran" class="profile-avatar-mobile block md:hidden w-[260px] mx-auto mb-4">

    <div class="text-column max-w-[500px] flex-1 flex flex-col max-md:max-w-full">
      <h1 class="greeting flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-5xl font-semibold mb-6 text-text-primary max-md:text-2xl">
        <span class="greeting-prefix font-normal">hi! i'm</span>
        <span class="name-logo inline-flex items-center gap-1">
          <span class="name-text">deanna</span>
        </span>
      </h1>

      <p class="typewriter-paragraph mb-5">
        <span class="typewriter-target">I live in Queens, NYC</span>
        <span class="typewriter-label"> with an assertive cat and my wonderful partner.</span>
      </p>

      <p class="typewriter-paragraph mb-5">
        <span class="typewriter-target">i'm a senior product engineer</span>
        <span class="typewriter-label"> at cloudflare. The best way to describe my role is like an internal forward-deployed engineer across our security and trust organization.</span>
      </p>

      <p class="typewriter-paragraph mb-5">
        <span class="typewriter-target">i focus on fixing underlying workflows instead of just digitizing broken ones</span>
        <span class="typewriter-label"> by dropping into teams to map the customer problem, define the technical roadmap, and ship.</span>
      </p>

      <p class="fade-paragraph mb-5">before cloudflare, i was at early-stage startups spinning up design systems and pivoting lots.</p>

      <p class="typewriter-paragraph mb-5">
        <span class="typewriter-label">outside of work, I love tinkering on random things and watching basketball.</span>
        <span class="typewriter-target">i love my cat, lion</span>
        <span class="typewriter-label">.</span>
      </p>

      <img src="/Main%20cat%20playing.svg" alt="Lion playing" class="cat-playing w-[280px] h-auto block mt-auto ml-auto mr-0 mb-2">
    </div>
    
    <!-- Desktop: kawaii_me SVG, its own column -->
    <img src="/kawaii_me.svg" alt="Deanna Tran" class="profile-avatar hidden md:block w-[350px] h-auto z-10 shrink-0">
  </section>

  <script is:inline src="/scripts/staggeredFade.js"></script>
</BaseLayout>
